     data-ad-slot="6987262141"
     data-ad-format="auto"></ins>
<script>
(adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});
</script>
</div>

<div id="video-screen">

<iframe width="1050" height="591" src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/2C68nicab4s" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>

</div>

<h3>About</h3>
<p>Released in December 1997, this is the promo video for Enya single <a href="/paint-the-sky-with-stars#Only_If...">"Only If..."</a>, from the album <a href="/paint-the-sky-with-stars"><em>Paint The Sky With Stars</em></a>.</p>
<p>Time: 3:15</p>
<p>Directed Dan Nathan.</p>

<p>"Only If..." is a song by the Irish artist Enya. It was released along with her first greatest hits compilation Paint the Sky with Stars on 3 November 1997. It charted in several countries and its video was noted for its creative direction. Enya promoted the song with interviews and performances on The Rosie O'Donnell Show, Late Show with David Letterman and Royal Variety Performance. </p>

<p><strong><a href="/enya-video">&laquo; EnyaTube home</a></strong></p>

</div>

</div>
